{
  "_doc": "Manifest consumed ONLY by scripts/create-project.sh, at project creation time. Unlike config-links.json (symlink, resynced on every link-config.mjs run, real-file override skips it), this manifest COPIES each source file once into a brand-new project and substitutes {{SITE_NAME}}, {{ENTITY_NAME}}, {{CONTACT_EMAIL}} and {{PROJECT_NAME}} with the values collected by the create-project.sh prompts. The resulting files are plain, project-owned files from that point on — no tool ever re-copies or re-links them after creation, so they are safe to customize freely (Header, Footer, PageLayout, Router, Title, landing page, legal placeholder pages, minimal front/back bootstrap). The \"pwa\" group is copied only when project.config.json has pwa.enabled; in every copied file the {{#PWA}} ... {{/PWA}} blocks are kept or dropped accordingly and the {{PWA_*}} placeholders filled (see filterPwaBlocks in scripts/lib/project-engine.mjs). Paths are relative to this submodule root (source) and to the new project root (target).",
